// The declaration of the operator of the C++ module `modules/this` (design principles 6.4;
// handover H19, step 10). This file is the one source of its signature; the C++ side keeps the
// kernel and the executor. A declaration names `this:<function>` by convention, so no `#op` tag
// is needed.

module this

/// The Zen of Camel, the text of the file ZEN.
/// @pure
/// @example println(zen())
export func zen(): string